WEBVTT

00:00:02.910 --> 00:00:05.180
<i>The snow's been coming down all day.</i>

00:00:05.390 --> 00:00:07.480
<i>It's a sea of white out there.</i>

00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:11.710
Hanadori? Hey, Hanadori!

00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:13.300
Is he absent today?

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:17.730
<i>I'm sure he's just waiting to make
another dramatic entrance...</i>

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:22.280
Sorry I'm so late.

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:24.500
What's with the weather?

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:25.870
This blizzard...

00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:28.750
It'd better not be that 
Gestöber guy showing off.

00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:50.360
<b>A Destructive God Sits Next to Me</b>

00:02:01.390 --> 00:02:06.390
<b><i>Delusion 12</i></b>

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:06.560
I'm late because of this bliz— 
I mean, because of Gestöber.

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:07.820
<i>What? What's happening?</i>

00:02:07.820 --> 00:02:08.890
<i>Why's he blaming me?</i>

00:02:08.890 --> 00:02:12.260
What kind of name is Gestöber, anyway?

00:02:12.260 --> 00:02:13.800
