00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:15.730
<i>You're the one who came up with it!</i>

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:19.480
Kabu-dono, I dare say I agree!

00:02:19.480 --> 00:02:20.160
<i>You dare say?</i>

00:02:20.330 --> 00:02:24.260
Koyukichi-dono, no... 
Koyukichi-dummy is being a jerk.

00:02:24.260 --> 00:02:25.800
<i>Did you really just say that?</i>

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:27.200
Seri-kun, Seri-kun...

00:02:27.900 --> 00:02:29.340
You stray cat!

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:31.690
Go for a run with a fish in your mouth!

00:02:31.690 --> 00:02:32.960
<i>What kind of insult is that?</i>

00:02:32.960 --> 00:02:34.920
Hey, now. Are you guys having a fight?

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:38.180
All right, people! Get ready 
for first period, and don't be late.

00:02:38.180 --> 00:02:39.920
<i>What's with everyone?</i>

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:42.160
Wimp.

00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:43.150
Baby monkey.

00:02:43.150 --> 00:02:44.600
