00:02:45.290 --> 00:02:46.180
Let's go.

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:47.730
He's so lame.

00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:52.400
<i>Huh? What's going on?</i>

00:02:52.760 --> 00:02:55.280
<i>Did everyone's personality change?</i>

00:02:58.680 --> 00:03:01.860
<i>It's a relief to not have them 
on my back all the time,</i>

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:04.400
<i>but this is also really annoying.</i>

00:03:04.680 --> 00:03:06.710
<i>What's gotten into them today?</i>

