00:06:33.440 --> 00:06:35.250
<i>Don't blame me when I don't come!</i>

00:06:35.250 --> 00:06:37.880
<i>If I do, Hanadori-kun will 
let it go to his head again!</i>

00:06:38.280 --> 00:06:40.270
