00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:21.990
RIP
Koyuki

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:21.990
RIP
Koyuki

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:21.990
RIP
Koyuki

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:21.990
RIP
Koyuki

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:21.990
RIP
Koyuki

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:21.990
RIP
Koyuki

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:21.990
RIP
Koyuki

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:15.510
<i>And so we all agreed never
 to speak of this day again,</i>

00:11:15.510 --> 00:11:18.520
<i>and my soul felt as frozen 
as the blizzard outside.</i>

00:11:18.520 --> 00:11:21.280
I had a great time!

00:11:22.430 --> 00:11:24.070
Welcome home, Gestöber.

00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:26.640
Do you want dinner first? Or a bath?

00:11:26.640 --> 00:11:27.780
Or...

00:11:28.050 --> 00:11:29.250
Miguel?

00:11:29.550 --> 00:11:31.140
Just kidding!

00:11:32.710 --> 00:11:35.670
<b>Several Days Earlier</b>

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:38.630
The bathroom and toilet 
should really be separate.

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:40.540
What are you talking about?

00:11:40.540 --> 00:11:43.630
A place where the toilet's in one 
room and the bath's in another.

00:11:43.630 --> 00:11:47.720
For a student living on their own, 
having a dedicated bathroom is nice,

00:11:47.720 --> 00:11:50.100
but when you have roommates, 
you want some privacy, right?

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:53.020
<i>Roommates... Am I going to have roommates?</i>

00:11:50.620 --> 00:11:52.920
I want a place where 
Cerberus can live with me!

00:11:53.020 --> 00:11:54.940
Want to rent a whole house together?

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:55.140
<i>Just out of the blue?</i>

00:11:55.140 --> 00:11:57.020
Oh, great idea!

00:11:57.020 --> 00:11:58.450
The Migeowa House!

00:11:58.450 --> 00:12:00.170
<i>Where'd the "owa" come from?!</i>

00:12:01.180 --> 00:12:02.980
Remember when we talked about that?

00:12:03.460 --> 00:12:08.120
So now we're here to look at a model house!

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:08.950
<b>Model</b>

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:08.950
<b>Model</b>

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:10.660
<i>Wait, wait, wait! Why am I here?</i>

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:12.210
<i>What are you even talking about?</i>

00:12:12.210 --> 00:12:14.500
<i>Why are we looking at a house right now?</i>

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:15.790
Aw, don't be silly.

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:19.820
If by some miracle you get into college, 
you'll be living alone, right?

00:12:19.820 --> 00:12:20.650
'Cause of the distance.

00:12:20.650 --> 00:12:21.990
<i>By some miracle?!</i>

00:12:21.990 --> 00:12:24.200
<i>If I'm living alone, 
this has nothing to do with me!</i>

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:27.050
<i>I don't know about you guys, though.</i>

00:12:27.800 --> 00:12:33.160
It's a three-story, four-bedroom 
model home all set for viewing.

00:12:33.160 --> 00:12:33.960
<i>Wait...</i>

00:12:33.960 --> 00:12:36.860
I know the landlord, and he's 
letting us take a tour.

00:12:36.860 --> 00:12:39.330
<i>Hey, why am I here?</i>

00:12:39.330 --> 00:12:40.790
<i>I've got a bad feeling ab—</i>

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:44.720
Don't be arrogant, Seri-kun!

00:12:44.720 --> 00:12:47.280
You didn't even try to 
walk here on your own.

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:49.640
Don't think you can live on your own!

00:12:49.640 --> 00:12:51.690
<i>I don't even know what you're talking about...</i>

00:12:51.690 --> 00:12:53.500
<i>And don't lock the door like that.</i>

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:55.600
<i>If I'd wanted to come, I would have walked!</i>

00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:56.760
<i>Operative word being "if"!</i>

00:12:56.760 --> 00:12:59.040
It's okay, Gestöber.

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:01.080
We're not moving in today or anything.

00:13:01.080 --> 00:13:02.760
We're just taking a tour.

00:13:02.760 --> 00:13:04.170
A tour!

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:05.800
<i>I know that.</i>

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:07.510
<i>You're really insulting me.</i>

00:13:07.510 --> 00:13:08.850
<i>What I mean is...</i>

00:13:08.850 --> 00:13:09.640
<i>No!</i>

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:09.640
That's right!

00:13:09.980 --> 00:13:15.140
We've come here to get an idea of the kind
of place we'll all be sharing in college!

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:20.500
Think of it as the secret base of 
the dark god of destruction group!

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:21.760
<i>I knew it!</i>

00:13:21.760 --> 00:13:23.500
<i>I had no idea what they were talking about,</i>

00:13:23.500 --> 00:13:25.910
<i>but now I see where this is going!</i>

00:13:26.080 --> 00:13:28.520
We did that mock interview,

00:13:28.520 --> 00:13:30.580
so now we're doing mock college life!

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:31.570
<i>No, no... No way.</i>

00:13:31.760 --> 00:13:32.860
Here's the layout.

00:13:32.860 --> 00:13:33.620
<i>No way, no how!</i>

00:13:33.840 --> 00:13:35.870
<i>Maybe, just maybe,</i>

00:13:33.840 --> 00:13:35.920
Let's start with the first floor!

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:38.580
<i>I'd be willing to go to an open campus 
or even look into a student dorm.</i>

00:13:38.580 --> 00:13:40.080
<i>But sharing a house?</i>

00:13:40.080 --> 00:13:41.760
The first floor is a single room.

00:13:41.760 --> 00:13:42.980
Maybe it's the guest room?

00:13:42.980 --> 00:13:43.930
So fancy!

00:13:43.930 --> 00:13:47.100
I know! This can be Cerberus's room!

00:13:47.100 --> 00:13:49.380
Wow, he'll be living in luxury!

00:13:49.380 --> 00:13:51.210
Isn't that nice, Berus-dono?

00:13:51.900 --> 00:13:54.600
<i>I had an inkling this was coming, 
but do these guys...</i>

00:13:54.870 --> 00:13:59.470
<i>Do they think they're not only going to 
college with me, but living with me, too?</i>

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:03.710
<i>We haven't even taken entrance exams! 
It's too early for all this!</i>

00:14:03.710 --> 00:14:04.900
<i>Be serious!</i>

00:14:05.540 --> 00:14:06.950
Why won't the door open?

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:08.280
Hey, someone open up!

00:14:08.980 --> 00:14:12.230
<i>I wanted to be rid of them and enjoy 
a new life after graduation...</i>

00:14:12.230 --> 00:14:14.040
Koyukichi-dono, Koyukichi-dono!

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:16.740
According to this, the bathroom 
is on the second floor.

00:14:17.070 --> 00:14:19.940
I'd like to have a waterfall 
come down from the window.

00:14:19.940 --> 00:14:23.120
Could you help foot the water bill?

00:14:23.120 --> 00:14:25.340
<i>No, and not just because of the water bill.</i>

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:27.120
There's no room for Mogami.

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:27.360
<b>H
M
P
H</b>

00:14:27.120 --> 00:14:32.260
The four rooms are for Gestöber, 
me, Tsukimiya, and Cerberus!

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:33.080
<i>That's awful.</i>

00:14:33.080 --> 00:14:34.680
<i>I'm not living here, so he can have mine.</i>

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:37.420
Want to live in Cerberus's old dog house?

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:40.520
Cerberus

00:14:37.420 --> 00:14:38.410
<i>That's really mean.</i>

00:14:38.410 --> 00:14:40.520
<i>Give him Cerberus's room.</i>

00:14:40.680 --> 00:14:42.300
If you insist, Koyukichi-dono...

00:14:42.300 --> 00:14:43.370
<i>I don't.</i>

00:14:43.560 --> 00:14:45.000
If you insist...

00:14:45.370 --> 00:14:47.790
Go on. Get in there.

00:14:47.790 --> 00:14:49.180
Sit, Fido.

00:14:49.180 --> 00:14:49.790
<i>Not saying that.</i>

00:14:50.250 --> 00:14:51.250
<i>Don't make that noise!</i>

00:14:51.720 --> 00:14:55.240
Berus-dono, can I live in your dog house?

00:14:55.640 --> 00:14:57.720
Cerberus is so kind.

00:14:57.700 --> 00:14:58.910
<i>Oh, jeez...</i>

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:01.020
Isn't that nice, Mogami-senpai?

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:03.280
<i>If I want to get away from these guys, 
I'll have to go to a school really far away.</i>

00:15:03.280 --> 00:15:04.300
<i>But then...</i>

00:15:04.300 --> 00:15:05.260
Koyuki-kun!

00:15:05.260 --> 00:15:07.680
<i>Where is Sumiso-san going after graduation?</i>

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:12.200
Hanadori, what will you do 
if Seri-kun brings a girl home?

00:15:12.200 --> 00:15:14.260
<i>Don't say weird things. He'll get all sulky.</i>

00:15:16.740 --> 00:15:18.860
Gestöber? Get a girlfriend?!

00:15:18.860 --> 00:15:20.120
No way!

00:15:20.120 --> 00:15:21.680
<i>I'll kill you!</i>

00:15:21.680 --> 00:15:23.280
<i>You're one to talk!</i>

00:15:23.270 --> 00:15:31.470
<b>I can't believe how happy I am...</b>

00:15:23.270 --> 00:15:31.630
<b>Seri & —— @ forever</b>

00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:26.240
If Seri-kun ever did get a girlfriend, 
he's the kind of guy

00:15:26.250 --> 00:15:30.460
who'd get super excited about it
 and make a joint social media account.

00:15:30.460 --> 00:15:36.420
Then, when they break up, he'll black out
 his icon and post, "We broke up"!

00:15:31.470 --> 00:15:39.870
<b>We broke up</b>

00:15:36.420 --> 00:15:38.380
I'll mash the like button when that happens!

00:15:38.380 --> 00:15:39.880
<i>Stop it! I'm about to get pissed!</i>

00:15:39.880 --> 00:15:42.360
Forget that. Let's go to the second floor.

00:15:42.360 --> 00:15:45.540
That's where the common spaces are, 
so we'll be spending most of our time there.

00:15:45.540 --> 00:15:47.760
Can I come over to hang out, too?

00:15:47.760 --> 00:15:48.720
Of course!

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:51.980
Gestöber, I'll cook for you.

00:15:51.980 --> 00:15:55.320
Miguel's special miso soup is nice and warm!

00:15:55.320 --> 00:15:57.430
<i>The dark god of destruction is so domestic.</i>

00:15:57.430 --> 00:15:59.240
<i>Did he forget his actual job?</i>

00:16:01.020 --> 00:16:02.920
A kitchen with a breakfast counter!

00:16:04.340 --> 00:16:06.780
Here you guys go.

00:16:06.780 --> 00:16:08.600
It's just leftovers, but enjoy!

00:16:08.600 --> 00:16:09.450
Yay!

00:16:09.450 --> 00:16:11.280
Let's eat!

00:16:12.150 --> 00:16:15.700
You're still growing students, after all.

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:17.720
I want to feed you lots.

00:16:17.720 --> 00:16:19.120
<i>What, you're not a student, too?</i>

00:16:19.120 --> 00:16:20.960
<i>Why are you acting like a mom?</i>

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:24.920
When Daddy Gestöber comes home,
 let's open this special canned crab for him.

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:27.120
I can't wait for Daddy to come home!

00:16:24.930 --> 00:16:27.110
<i>I'm the dad? Canned crab?</i>

00:16:27.110 --> 00:16:30.240
There he is! It's Daddy Gestöber! Welcome home!

00:16:30.240 --> 00:16:31.300
Daddy Gestöber!

00:16:30.810 --> 00:16:34.140
<i>We're just playing house at this point...</i>

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:32.510
Father!

00:16:34.140 --> 00:16:36.350
Look, Daddy! Canned crab!

00:16:36.350 --> 00:16:37.630
I want some, too!

00:16:37.630 --> 00:16:38.780
Me, too!

00:16:38.780 --> 00:16:41.640
Crab! Crab! Crab!

00:16:38.780 --> 00:16:41.640
<i>Why are you all so excited, damn it?!</i>

00:16:41.730 --> 00:16:45.810
Balcony

00:16:41.790 --> 00:16:45.810
4.5-mat room

00:16:41.830 --> 00:16:45.810
6-mat room

00:16:41.870 --> 00:16:45.810
Loft

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:45.810
5-mat room

00:16:42.040 --> 00:16:45.810
Balcony

00:16:42.260 --> 00:16:43.610
Next is the third floor,

00:16:43.610 --> 00:16:45.540
where we have our private rooms!

00:16:45.890 --> 00:16:49.900
There's a 6-mat room, 
a 5-mat room, and a 4.5-mat room.

00:16:50.100 --> 00:16:51.680
But, well...

00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:56.750
I think it's only fair to decide who gets
 the bigger rooms based on height.

00:16:56.750 --> 00:16:58.820
<i>So I get the 4.5-mat room, huh?</i>

00:16:58.820 --> 00:17:01.340
<i>I knew. That's the kind of guy you are.</i>

00:17:02.210 --> 00:17:04.910
Gestöber, look! A loft bed!

00:17:04.910 --> 00:17:07.900
You could fit in the space under it!

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:09.540
<i>Why? I'd rather have my own room.</i>

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:11.380
<i>Let Mogami-kun stay there.</i>

00:17:11.380 --> 00:17:15.210
If I install shelving here, 
I can safely store Gestöber!

00:17:15.210 --> 00:17:17.640
<i>Why do I need to be stored like some... thing?!</i>

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:20.180
Seri-kun, that was a weak comeback!

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:22.520
I brought some snacks!

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:25.560
Koyukichi-dono, you can sit on me.

00:17:25.310 --> 00:17:26.520
<b>G L O O M</b>

00:17:28.200 --> 00:17:32.860
Koyukichi-dono, sink all the way 
into the tub and warm up.

00:17:32.860 --> 00:17:36.070
I'll wash your back later.

00:17:36.160 --> 00:17:37.920
<i>He stuffed me into the tub.</i>

00:17:37.920 --> 00:17:40.000
<i>If there was water in here,
 wouldn't I be dead?</i>

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:43.490
I'll just bathe in your bathwater
once you're done.

00:17:43.990 --> 00:17:47.210
Okay, Seri-kun, open up!

00:17:47.930 --> 00:17:50.830
You need to brush your teeth before bed!

00:17:50.830 --> 00:17:53.010
<i>S-Stop! I can do it myself!</i>

00:17:53.010 --> 00:17:55.010
<i>I know you're going to ram it down my throat!</i>

00:17:55.010 --> 00:17:57.760
Time to get clean!

00:17:59.260 --> 00:18:00.480
<i>I'm so tired...</i>

00:18:00.480 --> 00:18:04.500
<i>I can't remember the last time I yelled—
talked so much in my own head.</i>

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:07.520
Gestöber stole my bed...

00:18:07.720 --> 00:18:11.510
My bed... Wah...

00:18:07.930 --> 00:18:11.500
<i>There's no way I can live with these people.</i>

00:18:11.510 --> 00:18:12.770
Gestöber...

00:18:12.770 --> 00:18:16.320
<i>I know! I'll go to school overseas!</i>

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:18.490
Even though you can't 
speak a word of English?

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:24.050
Miguel-senpai, how about we break out 
the futons and have a pajama party?

00:18:24.280 --> 00:18:27.000
<i>I won't let them play on 
my sympathies anymore.</i>

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:29.880
You can't bring up pajama parties
 around Koyukichi-dono.

00:18:29.880 --> 00:18:30.710
Because...

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:32.840
<i>I won't yell at them, 
even in my own head.</i>

00:18:32.840 --> 00:18:35.380
Okay, let's all take a nap!

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:37.340
<i>Why is your eye mask lopsided?!</i>

00:18:37.340 --> 00:18:39.490
Seri-kun, what did you 
just say you wouldn't do?

00:18:39.490 --> 00:18:43.680
I'll sleep on one side of Gestöber, 
and Helius can sleep on the other.

00:18:43.680 --> 00:18:46.670
I'd rather sleep next to you, Miguel-senpai.

00:18:46.670 --> 00:18:49.070
Then I'll be Koyukichi-dono's futon myself!

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:49.070
<i>No!</i>

00:18:49.070 --> 00:18:51.040
<i>If I live in this house, I'll...</i>

00:18:56.070 --> 00:18:57.820
<i>I'll kill them all!</i>

00:18:57.820 --> 00:18:59.950
I-I finally did it...

00:19:00.710 --> 00:19:05.080
<i>No! My life is ruined!</i>

00:19:00.880 --> 00:19:03.780
Okay, let's all have a lot 
of fun living together!

00:19:03.780 --> 00:19:05.660
Yeah!

00:19:06.490 --> 00:19:12.870
Of course, it'd be wonderful if days 
like this could continue forever.

00:19:26.700 --> 00:19:28.810
Well, it's just the order of things.

00:19:28.810 --> 00:19:31.070
Nothing lasts forever.

00:19:31.070 --> 00:19:33.610
Everything always changes.

00:19:33.610 --> 00:19:37.620
Not even Koyukichi-dono and I
 could remain the same forever.

00:19:37.620 --> 00:19:40.780
B-But I want to be with 
Miguel-senpai forever...

00:19:40.780 --> 00:19:43.780
Helius, you fool! We all promised not to cry!

00:19:44.040 --> 00:19:47.700
B-But you're crying too, Miguel-senpai...

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:04.740
I thought I could always be with 
Gestöber and the rest of you.

00:20:04.740 --> 00:20:06.700
I wanted to try and live together.

00:20:07.140 --> 00:20:09.400
So I dragged you all here...

00:20:09.400 --> 00:20:11.050
Miguel-senpai...

00:20:11.050 --> 00:20:13.100
<i>Wh-What is this?</i>

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:19.010
Gestöber, you may not remember
 everything from our past life,

00:20:19.010 --> 00:20:21.820
but our time together will 
one day come to an end.

00:20:22.040 --> 00:20:24.470
For now, I want you to focus on what we have

00:20:24.470 --> 00:20:26.540
so that, when it's over, you'll have no regrets.

00:20:26.790 --> 00:20:31.000
But I've always enjoyed my time with you.

00:20:32.240 --> 00:20:34.710
Thank you, Gestöber.

00:20:34.710 --> 00:20:38.060
Wh-What? Are you going 
somewhere, Hanadori-kun?

00:20:39.460 --> 00:20:42.020
<i>What? Did something happen?</i>

00:20:42.710 --> 00:20:48.630
<i>Did he... Did he drag us 
all here to say goodbye?</i>

00:20:50.490 --> 00:20:51.940
Nope, I'm not going anywhere!

00:20:53.390 --> 00:20:54.540
Surprised?

00:20:54.540 --> 00:20:56.330
Don't worry, Gestöber!

00:20:56.330 --> 00:20:59.040
I'll always be by your side!

00:20:59.040 --> 00:21:01.270
Can I be with you too, Miguel-senpai?

00:21:01.270 --> 00:21:02.330
Of course!

00:21:02.330 --> 00:21:04.600
I'll be here too, Koyukichi-dono!

00:21:04.600 --> 00:21:06.110
Isn't that great, Hanadori?

00:21:06.870 --> 00:21:11.690
I was a little worried that you 
might not actually care about me,

00:21:11.690 --> 00:21:13.830
because you're always so gloomy and mean.

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:17.290
I thought that maybe if you 
believed it would end someday,

00:21:17.290 --> 00:21:20.550
you'd start to care about 
the time you had with me.

00:21:20.550 --> 00:21:22.220
So I played a little trick on you!

00:21:23.140 --> 00:21:24.960
I'll end it right now!

00:21:26.080 --> 00:21:27.770
Miguel-senpai!

00:21:27.770 --> 00:21:28.980
Oh, dear...

00:21:28.980 --> 00:21:29.770
<i>Damn it all.</i>

00:21:29.770 --> 00:21:31.410
<i>I thought this was the last episode.</i>

00:21:31.410 --> 00:21:35.060
But it's true that nothing 
stays the same forever.

00:21:35.380 --> 00:21:38.810
You can't be "friends forever" for eternity.

00:21:35.810 --> 00:21:37.360
Miguel-senpai!

00:21:37.360 --> 00:21:38.810
Oh, you survived.

00:21:39.560 --> 00:21:40.780
<i>Of course!</i>

00:21:41.050 --> 00:21:44.760
<i>One day, I'll even win my battle 
to stop yelling at him!</i>

